1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 22=

4
00:01:59,100 --> 00:01:59,930
You still

5
00:02:00,900 --> 00:02:02,130
carry a knife around?

6
00:02:23,570 --> 00:02:25,410
Is this how Sheng'an welcomes
its guests?

7
00:02:29,130 --> 00:02:29,940
Without an audience at court

8
00:02:31,220 --> 00:02:31,940
there are to be no private visits.

9
00:02:33,100 --> 00:02:33,730
General Meng,

10
00:02:34,610 --> 00:02:35,820
don't you know the rules?

11
00:02:37,380 --> 00:02:38,340
A military governor

12
00:02:39,130 --> 00:02:40,010
must attend court

13
00:02:41,010 --> 00:02:42,260
before requesting a private audience.

14
00:02:42,940 --> 00:02:43,980
How cold.

15
00:02:46,130 --> 00:02:48,540
Tonight, I'm not the governor
paying respects to Your Highness.

16
00:02:49,690 --> 00:02:50,660
I'm here as an old friend

17
00:02:51,130 --> 00:02:52,100
to visit my old friend.

18
00:02:54,290 --> 00:02:54,730
What,

19
00:02:56,010 --> 00:02:57,100
not happy to see an old friend?

20
00:02:57,660 --> 00:02:58,690
You have no friends here!

21
00:03:02,780 --> 00:03:04,690
You won't get the better of me.

22
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:11,450
Blades are dangerous.

23
00:03:13,170 --> 00:03:14,100
You'd better calm down.

24
00:03:21,340 --> 00:03:22,340
You may be heartless,

25
00:03:23,890 --> 00:03:25,100
but I can't be ungrateful.

26
00:03:30,340 --> 00:03:32,980
Back in North Jing, I often wondered

27
00:03:34,570 --> 00:03:35,780
how you'd fare

28
00:03:37,820 --> 00:03:38,730
after returning to the capital.

29
00:03:40,660 --> 00:03:42,380
Would you lie awake at night,

30
00:03:45,170 --> 00:03:45,980
haunted by the man you'd killed?

31
00:03:47,450 --> 00:03:48,130
As you can see,

32
00:03:49,170 --> 00:03:49,980
I'm doing just fine.

33
00:03:51,610 --> 00:03:52,260
Really?

34
00:03:54,010 --> 00:03:54,940
If you're doing well,

35
00:03:56,060 --> 00:03:57,260
then I'm happy for you.

36
00:03:58,890 --> 00:03:59,429
But...

37
00:03:59,471 --> 00:03:59,961
Your Highness?

38
00:04:04,570 --> 00:04:05,220
Who's there?

39
00:04:12,730 --> 00:04:13,290
It's me.

40
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:30,370
Your Highness, are you still awake?

41
00:04:30,900 --> 00:04:31,730
Yan Shang requests an audience.

42
00:04:37,850 --> 00:04:39,460
So, it's your new favorite.

43
00:04:40,780 --> 00:04:41,700
While I was away,

44
00:04:42,490 --> 00:04:43,700
he kept you company.

45
00:04:44,370 --> 00:04:46,020
I suppose he deserves some credit.

46
00:04:47,340 --> 00:04:48,170
Why not let him in

47
00:04:49,370 --> 00:04:50,370
so I can thank him?

48
00:04:51,050 --> 00:04:52,020
I didn't summon you.

49
00:04:52,220 --> 00:04:52,850
What brings you here?

50
00:04:56,810 --> 00:04:59,490
You seem troubled tonight,
Your Highness.

51
00:05:00,370 --> 00:05:02,020
I was worried you wouldn't sleep well,

52
00:05:02,610 --> 00:05:03,460
so I came to see

53
00:05:04,140 --> 00:05:05,079
if you needed anything.

54
00:05:05,121 --> 00:05:05,601
No, thank you.

55
00:05:15,540 --> 00:05:16,580
I'm worried about you.

56
00:05:17,370 --> 00:05:18,140
May I come in?

57
00:05:25,660 --> 00:05:26,370
I'm tired.

58
00:05:26,730 --> 00:05:27,490
I'm turning in.

59
00:05:28,930 --> 00:05:29,540
Go back.

60
00:05:30,020 --> 00:05:30,490
Do as I say.

61
00:05:37,980 --> 00:05:39,050
You're tired and troubled.

62
00:05:39,850 --> 00:05:41,220
This is when you need me most.

63
00:05:42,730 --> 00:05:44,410
Why send me away?

64
00:05:45,100 --> 00:05:45,490
Unless...

65
00:05:46,020 --> 00:05:47,100
You've grown tired of me

66
00:05:47,410 --> 00:05:48,290
and found someone else.

67
00:05:49,250 --> 00:05:50,410
Why make it so hard?

68
00:05:52,250 --> 00:05:53,580
Let him in to join us.

69
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:55,540
What's the harm?

70
00:05:59,460 --> 00:06:00,220
Will you ever stop?

71
00:06:01,410 --> 00:06:02,700
I'm tired. Can't you understand?

72
00:06:04,050 --> 00:06:04,490
Your Highness...

73
00:06:04,540 --> 00:06:05,780
Keep this up,
and you'll never see me again.

74
00:06:06,220 --> 00:06:06,610
Go back now!

75
00:06:14,730 --> 00:06:15,100
Understood.

76
00:06:16,410 --> 00:06:17,140
As you wish.

77
00:06:35,580 --> 00:06:37,460
Why must you be so harsh?

78
00:06:42,170 --> 00:06:44,020
I almost feel sorry for that poor lad.

79
00:06:45,370 --> 00:06:46,540
I have no time for your nonsense.

80
00:06:48,980 --> 00:06:50,580
What exactly do you want?

81
00:06:51,250 --> 00:06:52,410
Once you're back in North Jing with me,

82
00:06:53,810 --> 00:06:55,100
you really should learn

83
00:06:55,850 --> 00:06:57,170
to control that temper of yours.

84
00:06:57,410 --> 00:06:58,490
Who said I'd go back with you?

85
00:07:01,660 --> 00:07:02,980
You've got quite a short memory.

86
00:07:05,290 --> 00:07:07,340
Who was flirting with me back then?

87
00:07:08,020 --> 00:07:09,490
Who begged me to take her away?

88
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:12,340
Wasn't it you?

89
00:07:23,850 --> 00:07:25,250
You certainly have a way with stories.

90
00:07:26,370 --> 00:07:27,100
But never mind.

91
00:07:28,580 --> 00:07:29,610
Since I returned to the capital,

92
00:07:30,220 --> 00:07:31,700
I've been the subject

93
00:07:32,410 --> 00:07:34,250
of countless rumors.

94
00:07:35,460 --> 00:07:36,460
And yours is hardly

95
00:07:36,980 --> 00:07:37,490
the strangest.

96
00:07:41,900 --> 00:07:43,580
Me, flirting with you?

97
00:07:46,340 --> 00:07:47,140
Go ahead and spread that story.

98
00:07:48,250 --> 00:07:49,810
Let's see how long the teahouses here

99
00:07:50,140 --> 00:07:50,900
gossip about it.

100
00:08:00,410 --> 00:08:02,660
Let's see how long
the secrets from North Jing

101
00:08:05,340 --> 00:08:06,930
keep Sheng'an buzzing.

102
00:08:12,980 --> 00:08:14,140
Given our history,

103
00:08:14,660 --> 00:08:16,370
let's cut to the chase.

104
00:08:17,460 --> 00:08:18,610
You can stay in Sheng'an,

105
00:08:18,900 --> 00:08:20,700
live in luxury
and keep your male favorites.

106
00:08:22,780 --> 00:08:24,900
Is it really because
your father dotes on you?

107
00:08:26,250 --> 00:08:28,410
Or because your title
as Princess Danyang

108
00:08:29,730 --> 00:08:31,250
makes you too valuable to touch?

109
00:08:35,220 --> 00:08:36,490
It's simply because

110
00:08:36,850 --> 00:08:37,940
you're a bargaining chip.

111
00:08:41,010 --> 00:08:42,460
We made a deal before.

112
00:08:43,420 --> 00:08:45,650
I'm just here to claim what I'm owed.

113
00:08:47,890 --> 00:08:48,820
Go ahead and try me.

114
00:08:54,530 --> 00:08:55,340
What if...

115
00:09:00,580 --> 00:09:02,490
I'd killed Meng Baiyu for you back then?

116
00:09:05,610 --> 00:09:07,340
Would we be together now?

117
00:09:08,700 --> 00:09:09,250
General Meng,

118
00:09:10,250 --> 00:09:11,100
things have changed.

119
00:09:11,530 --> 00:09:12,340
You should know that.

120
00:09:13,340 --> 00:09:15,180
Living in Sheng'an costs a fortune now.

121
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:17,770
My price

122
00:09:18,530 --> 00:09:19,490
isn't what it used to be.

123
00:09:20,770 --> 00:09:21,650
Let's hear it.

124
00:09:22,490 --> 00:09:23,460
Kill Yu Cheng'an for me,

125
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:24,460
and then we'll talk.

126
00:09:30,650 --> 00:09:31,700
Yu Cheng'an?

127
00:09:32,370 --> 00:09:34,060
You think killing Meng Baiyu was enough?

128
00:09:35,850 --> 00:09:37,580
Shouldn't the mastermind die too?

129
00:09:37,940 --> 00:09:39,530
So you hated Meng Baiyu

130
00:09:40,850 --> 00:09:42,130
not because you cared for me,

131
00:09:43,580 --> 00:09:44,980
but because you truly hated him.

132
00:09:45,340 --> 00:09:45,820
Of course.

133
00:09:47,820 --> 00:09:50,010
So you never had feelings for me.

134
00:09:52,060 --> 00:09:53,580
It was all a lie.

135
00:09:53,940 --> 00:09:54,490
That's right.

136
00:09:56,220 --> 00:09:57,420
You only figured that out now?

137
00:10:03,100 --> 00:10:04,940
I was only humoring you back then.

138
00:10:05,580 --> 00:10:06,010
Using you.

139
00:10:07,010 --> 00:10:07,770
I got close to you

140
00:10:08,610 --> 00:10:09,730
just to kill your uncle.

141
00:10:11,100 --> 00:10:13,220
Too bad I failed to kill you as well.

142
00:10:23,420 --> 00:10:24,370
Have you forgotten?

143
00:10:25,770 --> 00:10:26,850
When you left North Jing,

144
00:10:27,820 --> 00:10:28,980
you told me

145
00:10:29,610 --> 00:10:30,940
that I killed Meng Baiyu.

146
00:10:31,890 --> 00:10:32,940
Otherwise, how else

147
00:10:33,370 --> 00:10:34,770
would I have taken his place?

148
00:10:54,250 --> 00:10:54,650
Your Highness,

149
00:10:55,460 --> 00:10:55,890
it's me again.

150
00:10:58,850 --> 00:10:59,650
I've thought it over and over,

151
00:11:00,340 --> 00:11:01,300
but I still can't rest easy.

152
00:11:03,530 --> 00:11:04,220
Are you asleep?

153
00:11:08,730 --> 00:11:09,300
I'm coming in.

154
00:11:52,980 --> 00:11:53,530
Yan Shang,

155
00:11:54,130 --> 00:11:55,060
you've gone too far.

156
00:11:55,460 --> 00:11:55,980
Your Highness.

157
00:11:59,820 --> 00:12:00,650
Why is it you again?

158
00:12:01,420 --> 00:12:02,980
May I ask who you are, sir?

159
00:12:08,340 --> 00:12:08,770
Your Highness.

160
00:12:09,250 --> 00:12:10,100
You refused to see me

161
00:12:10,530 --> 00:12:12,060
so you could meet him here in secret?

162
00:12:12,650 --> 00:12:13,250
Show some respect!

163
00:12:14,650 --> 00:12:16,940
This is Military Governor Meng Zaishi

164
00:12:17,730 --> 00:12:18,730
of North Jing's Central Circuit.

165
00:12:21,610 --> 00:12:22,890
And this is Yan Shang,
this year's third-ranked scholar.

166
00:12:24,060 --> 00:12:25,100
I haven't taught him well.

167
00:12:25,610 --> 00:12:26,730
Please forgive his rudeness.

168
00:12:28,890 --> 00:12:30,180
Apologize to General Meng at once.

169
00:12:31,850 --> 00:12:34,100
Since you and Her Highness go way back,

170
00:12:34,530 --> 00:12:35,770
why did you frighten her

171
00:12:36,340 --> 00:12:37,100
at the night market earlier?

172
00:12:38,370 --> 00:12:39,460
This third-ranked scholar

173
00:12:40,010 --> 00:12:41,980
has to get to the bottom of things.

174
00:12:44,100 --> 00:12:45,490
You've spoiled him rotten.

175
00:12:45,770 --> 00:12:46,490
I already apologized.

176
00:12:47,010 --> 00:12:48,100
Please forgive his rudeness.

177
00:12:49,340 --> 00:12:50,370
When I was in North Jing,

178
00:12:50,980 --> 00:12:52,940
General Meng looked after me.
We were quite close.

179
00:12:53,980 --> 00:12:54,850
After such a long separation,

180
00:12:55,300 --> 00:12:56,460
we were just joking around.

181
00:12:57,300 --> 00:12:58,180
Yet you took it seriously.

182
00:13:00,530 --> 00:13:01,820
Your Highness knows so many people.

183
00:13:02,220 --> 00:13:03,420
Can you blame me for being suspicious?

184
00:13:04,100 --> 00:13:04,580
Enough.

185
00:13:05,220 --> 00:13:06,730
Watch your mouth
in front of General Meng.

186
00:13:07,580 --> 00:13:08,370
Have you no sense of propriety?

187
00:13:11,580 --> 00:13:12,490
General Meng, forgive me.

188
00:13:20,100 --> 00:13:20,610
It's late.

189
00:13:21,700 --> 00:13:23,180
Thanks for visiting me, General Meng.

190
00:13:23,530 --> 00:13:25,130
Perhaps you should head back now.

191
00:13:40,650 --> 00:13:41,890
You really care about him, huh?

192
00:13:43,610 --> 00:13:44,530
You came to see me

193
00:13:45,130 --> 00:13:45,890
without first attending court.

194
00:13:46,700 --> 00:13:47,650
That's a serious offense itself.

195
00:13:48,890 --> 00:13:50,420
If someone gets killed in my residence,

196
00:13:53,010 --> 00:13:54,180
do you think you'll make it back
to North Jing?

197
00:14:17,530 --> 00:14:18,460
Let him see me out.

198
00:14:19,700 --> 00:14:20,109
I'll do it...

199
00:14:20,151 --> 00:14:21,321
Allow me to see the General out.

200
00:14:31,180 --> 00:14:32,370
I'll come by again in a few days.

201
00:14:35,340 --> 00:14:36,490
Don't let a new favorite

202
00:14:37,730 --> 00:14:38,460
make you forget the old.

203
00:15:26,490 --> 00:15:26,820
Please.

204
00:15:32,250 --> 00:15:33,060
Come to think of it,

205
00:15:33,940 --> 00:15:35,460
I really should thank you.

206
00:15:36,890 --> 00:15:38,220
What for, General Meng?

207
00:15:40,460 --> 00:15:42,250
You're quite good at keeping her happy.

208
00:15:43,370 --> 00:15:44,940
While she's temporarily staying
in Sheng'an,

209
00:15:45,580 --> 00:15:46,650
knowing you're looking after her

210
00:15:47,250 --> 00:15:47,940
puts my mind at ease.

211
00:15:50,060 --> 00:15:51,010
You're too kind, General Meng.

212
00:15:51,820 --> 00:15:53,250
Sheng'an has always been her home.

213
00:15:53,730 --> 00:15:54,770
It's hardly a temporary stay.

214
00:15:55,650 --> 00:15:56,730
The Princess is of noble birth

215
00:15:57,130 --> 00:15:59,010
and the pride of the Huai.

216
00:15:59,770 --> 00:16:01,220
What a sharp tongue.

217
00:16:02,420 --> 00:16:03,700
So that's her type now.

218
00:16:05,770 --> 00:16:06,770
Mu Wanyao's temper

219
00:16:07,530 --> 00:16:08,250
isn't easy to deal with.

220
00:16:09,100 --> 00:16:09,820
Thanks for looking after her.

221
00:16:11,610 --> 00:16:12,060
It's my pleasure.

222
00:16:12,650 --> 00:16:14,890
In Sheng'an, hundreds upon hundreds

223
00:16:15,180 --> 00:16:16,100
admire Princess Danyang.

224
00:16:16,490 --> 00:16:18,010
To serve Her Highness up close

225
00:16:18,370 --> 00:16:19,890
is a blessing from a past life.

226
00:16:20,370 --> 00:16:21,650
Don't let her spoiled ways fool you.

227
00:16:22,490 --> 00:16:23,700
She has a lot on her mind.

228
00:16:25,730 --> 00:16:27,340
Does she still toss and turn at night,

229
00:16:28,650 --> 00:16:29,610
unable to sleep?

230
00:16:32,180 --> 00:16:33,490
Getting her to sleep is no easy feat.

231
00:16:34,130 --> 00:16:34,850
Third-Place Scholar,

232
00:16:35,890 --> 00:16:36,730
look after her well.

233
00:16:40,460 --> 00:16:41,820
Thanks for your concern.

234
00:16:42,530 --> 00:16:43,180
With me around,

235
00:16:43,770 --> 00:16:45,180
Her Highness always sleeps soundly.

236
00:16:52,650 --> 00:16:53,340
Watch your step.

237
00:17:10,380 --> 00:17:10,660
(Tierong, Meng Zaishi's personal guard)
General.

238
00:17:12,290 --> 00:17:12,620
General.

239
00:17:15,860 --> 00:17:16,330
Let's go.

240
00:17:17,380 --> 00:17:17,700
Go back.

241
00:17:17,940 --> 00:17:18,250
General,

242
00:17:19,050 --> 00:17:19,730
we've just received word.

243
00:17:19,980 --> 00:17:20,700
An incense stick ago,

244
00:17:20,940 --> 00:17:23,620
Governor Mu Xianqing of the Eastern
Circuit arrived outside Sheng'an.

245
00:17:25,180 --> 00:17:25,530
General,

246
00:17:25,940 --> 00:17:26,730
Mu Xianqing thinks

247
00:17:27,050 --> 00:17:29,140
you're still in North Jing.

248
00:17:30,330 --> 00:17:32,140
With his ragtag troops,

249
00:17:32,980 --> 00:17:34,530
he thinks he can keep me
out of the capital?

250
00:17:35,620 --> 00:17:36,220
What a joke.

251
00:17:36,700 --> 00:17:37,140
Exactly.

252
00:17:37,730 --> 00:17:39,010
He has no say

253
00:17:39,220 --> 00:17:40,220
in whether you come to Sheng'an.

254
00:17:41,420 --> 00:17:42,620
That old fool thinks

255
00:17:43,860 --> 00:17:45,309
that without the court's appointment

256
00:17:45,351 --> 00:17:46,311
and the Emperor's investiture,

257
00:17:46,810 --> 00:17:49,460
my claim to Meng Baiyu's post
is illegitimate.

258
00:17:50,180 --> 00:17:51,250
Let him keep thinking

259
00:17:51,860 --> 00:17:53,090
I won't make it in time
for the Longevity Festival

260
00:17:53,700 --> 00:17:54,620
or get to see the Emperor.

261
00:17:58,810 --> 00:17:59,490
Tierong.

262
00:18:01,050 --> 00:18:02,290
Tell me, what's so special

263
00:18:04,570 --> 00:18:05,940
about Sheng'an anyway?

264
00:18:30,420 --> 00:18:35,020
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

265
00:18:38,770 --> 00:18:39,180
Your Highness.

266
00:18:39,180 --> 00:18:42,090
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

267
00:18:42,090 --> 00:18:42,730
I'm fine.

268
00:18:44,660 --> 00:18:50,670
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

269
00:18:51,130 --> 00:18:56,070
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

270
00:18:59,180 --> 00:19:03,020
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

271
00:19:04,090 --> 00:19:04,980
Did he hurt you?

272
00:19:05,700 --> 00:19:06,900
You were too reckless earlier.

273
00:19:07,460 --> 00:19:08,250
You scared me.

274
00:19:08,380 --> 00:19:09,620
You scared me more.

275
00:19:10,810 --> 00:19:11,330
You know,

276
00:19:11,770 --> 00:19:13,700
I can always tell
when you don't mean it.

277
00:19:14,570 --> 00:19:15,250
When you're in danger,

278
00:19:16,220 --> 00:19:17,140
how could I not know?

279
00:19:18,090 --> 00:19:20,330
He's a vicious wolf from North Jing.

280
00:19:20,980 --> 00:19:22,330
He's capable of anything.

281
00:19:23,220 --> 00:19:25,380
He was plotting to kill you just now.

282
00:19:25,940 --> 00:19:26,770
Do you know?

283
00:19:26,870 --> 00:19:29,480
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

284
00:19:29,530 --> 00:19:30,330
He's a vicious wolf.

285
00:19:31,490 --> 00:19:33,010
All the more reason
I can't leave you alone.

286
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:40,430
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

287
00:19:41,300 --> 00:19:44,620
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

288
00:19:44,820 --> 00:19:48,289
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

289
00:19:48,331 --> 00:19:54,931
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

290
00:19:56,250 --> 00:19:56,770
What's wrong?

291
00:19:57,230 --> 00:19:59,480
♪- May time be free of pain
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

292
00:19:59,530 --> 00:20:01,290
Just like the day I shot Zheng Xing,

293
00:20:03,420 --> 00:20:04,730
having you by my side

294
00:20:05,940 --> 00:20:06,530
feels wonderful.

295
00:20:09,950 --> 00:20:13,070
♪- Be my one and only in this world
- Be my one and only in this life♪

296
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:15,360
♪My last untouched innocence♪

297
00:20:17,230 --> 00:20:20,920
♪- If there's still
- Some warmth left in this world♪

298
00:20:22,390 --> 00:20:24,670
♪You're the only one I need♪

299
00:21:03,220 --> 00:21:04,660
Your Majesty, it's past the hour of Mao.

300
00:21:04,770 --> 00:21:05,380
We must hurry.

301
00:21:06,090 --> 00:21:07,090
I know.

302
00:21:07,460 --> 00:21:08,220
Stop nagging!

303
00:21:08,330 --> 00:21:09,220
What's all the fuss?

304
00:21:09,620 --> 00:21:10,220
Get out!

305
00:21:13,380 --> 00:21:14,530
Aren't you tired?

306
00:21:15,050 --> 00:21:16,380
I'm even more exhausted than you!

307
00:21:28,700 --> 00:21:30,090
Longevity Festival.

308
00:21:34,940 --> 00:21:36,900
Long live the Emperor...

309
00:21:44,570 --> 00:21:45,770
Line up by rank.

310
00:21:46,010 --> 00:21:46,710
(Zheng Qian,
Secretary of Ministry of Rites)

311
00:21:46,710 --> 00:21:47,250
One at a time. No pushing.

312
00:21:57,010 --> 00:21:57,980
Meng Zaishi?

313
00:21:59,940 --> 00:22:01,290
I remember our teacher saying

314
00:22:02,090 --> 00:22:04,530
North Jing once had three circuits:
East, West, and Central.

315
00:22:04,900 --> 00:22:06,220
The Eastern Circuit
was always the strongest.

316
00:22:06,900 --> 00:22:09,220
Its military governor, Mu Xianqing,
is of the imperial clan.

317
00:22:10,250 --> 00:22:11,860
Yuan Jia, military governor
of the Western Circuit,

318
00:22:12,050 --> 00:22:13,900
always followed Mu Xianqing's lead.

319
00:22:14,660 --> 00:22:15,250
But then,

320
00:22:15,770 --> 00:22:17,420
the Central Circuit wiped him out.

321
00:22:18,330 --> 00:22:19,330
Isn't the Central Circuit

322
00:22:20,050 --> 00:22:21,530
where the Princess was married off?

323
00:22:24,940 --> 00:22:26,220
After its governor Meng Baiyu died,

324
00:22:26,660 --> 00:22:27,900
his cousin's son, Meng Zaishi,

325
00:22:28,250 --> 00:22:29,420
took over as military governor.

326
00:22:30,140 --> 00:22:31,620
He killed Yuan Jia himself.

327
00:22:33,090 --> 00:22:34,140
So it seems

328
00:22:34,660 --> 00:22:36,180
there are now two rival powers
in North Jing:

329
00:22:36,860 --> 00:22:38,700
Mu Xianqing and Meng Zaishi.

330
00:22:40,290 --> 00:22:42,420
The Eastern Circuit is powerful
and claims legitimacy.

331
00:22:43,050 --> 00:22:45,380
It's long had its eye
on the Mengs' territory.

332
00:22:48,180 --> 00:22:49,770
Looks like someone else

333
00:22:50,460 --> 00:22:51,900
is the one losing sleep,

334
00:22:53,050 --> 00:22:54,010
Meng Zaishi.

335
00:22:58,940 --> 00:23:00,770
This wine set must go before Lord Yu.

336
00:23:00,900 --> 00:23:01,770
No one else is to touch it.

337
00:23:01,940 --> 00:23:02,449
Understood?

338
00:23:02,491 --> 00:23:02,811
Got it.

339
00:23:02,900 --> 00:23:03,250
Go on!

340
00:23:08,980 --> 00:23:10,010
A little more.

341
00:23:10,490 --> 00:23:11,140
Honestly!

342
00:23:13,290 --> 00:23:13,940
You scared me!

343
00:23:14,490 --> 00:23:15,250
I'm sorry.

344
00:23:18,900 --> 00:23:20,420
Oh, it's Wenji.

345
00:23:21,180 --> 00:23:22,290
I'm not worthy of that.

346
00:23:22,980 --> 00:23:25,570
You're a big shot now.

347
00:23:29,050 --> 00:23:29,660
Excuse me.

348
00:23:32,380 --> 00:23:33,330
That's right.

349
00:23:33,730 --> 00:23:34,940
You're a man of importance now.

350
00:23:35,220 --> 00:23:36,660
Of course you don't have time for us.

351
00:23:37,730 --> 00:23:38,250
All right.

352
00:23:38,810 --> 00:23:39,380
Go on.

353
00:23:59,420 --> 00:24:01,420
I study late until midnight,

354
00:24:01,940 --> 00:24:03,530
learning characters.

355
00:24:03,770 --> 00:24:06,570
Even now, I can only make out
sixty or seventy percent of the gazette.

356
00:24:07,730 --> 00:24:08,420
Tell me,

357
00:24:09,810 --> 00:24:11,090
why does he know so many characters?

358
00:24:11,530 --> 00:24:13,420
Ever since he met Lord Yu,

359
00:24:13,980 --> 00:24:16,460
he's been acting like a big shot.

360
00:24:25,860 --> 00:24:26,860
The Central Circuit's military governor
is here!

361
00:24:40,660 --> 00:24:42,140
I forgot to warn you last night.

362
00:24:43,490 --> 00:24:45,700
If you want to keep your position,

363
00:24:48,290 --> 00:24:49,940
stay away from Mu Wanyao.

364
00:24:53,530 --> 00:24:54,570
General, you've got the wrong man.

365
00:24:55,380 --> 00:24:55,860
Last night,

366
00:24:56,460 --> 00:24:57,620
we never met.

367
00:25:01,730 --> 00:25:02,530
The military governor is here!

368
00:25:04,140 --> 00:25:05,199
The military governor is here!

369
00:25:05,241 --> 00:25:06,441
- It's Governor Mu!
- Where is he?

370
00:25:19,540 --> 00:25:23,740
(Mu Xianqing, Military Governor
of North Jing's Eastern Circuit)

371
00:25:33,660 --> 00:25:34,420
Governor Mu,

372
00:25:35,490 --> 00:25:36,220
it's been a while.

373
00:25:37,530 --> 00:25:38,730
But that's strange.

374
00:25:39,700 --> 00:25:41,570
I thought you'd get here before me.

375
00:25:44,050 --> 00:25:46,660
A brat really does move faster
than his elders.

376
00:26:23,860 --> 00:26:25,660
What an exquisite spread.

377
00:26:27,290 --> 00:26:28,050
The carvings are beautiful.

378
00:26:29,530 --> 00:26:30,309
It's been a while.

379
00:26:30,351 --> 00:26:30,768
It's been a while.

380
00:26:30,810 --> 00:26:31,770
It's been a while.

381
00:26:33,140 --> 00:26:34,090
Your Highness.

382
00:26:35,420 --> 00:26:36,980
Your Highness.

383
00:26:39,250 --> 00:26:40,220
Come on, Chunhua.

384
00:26:41,250 --> 00:26:42,330
Your Highness.

385
00:26:44,700 --> 00:26:45,220
Are you tired?

386
00:26:53,620 --> 00:26:54,490
Careful.

387
00:27:02,490 --> 00:27:03,010
Stand up!

388
00:27:14,140 --> 00:27:14,770
What a strong wind.

389
00:27:15,380 --> 00:27:16,010
It's freezing.

390
00:27:17,250 --> 00:27:18,620
The wind cuts right through you.

391
00:27:21,940 --> 00:27:22,770
How much longer must we wait?

392
00:27:23,620 --> 00:27:24,530
My hands are frozen.

393
00:27:25,090 --> 00:27:25,860
Who knows?

394
00:27:26,980 --> 00:27:28,250
Honestly, my hands are frozen solid.

395
00:27:50,810 --> 00:27:51,140
Mr. Wei.

396
00:27:56,660 --> 00:27:57,220
Hot eggs?

397
00:27:57,770 --> 00:27:58,330
Where'd you get them?

398
00:27:59,050 --> 00:27:59,700
Warm up your hands.

399
00:28:06,980 --> 00:28:08,860
Chunhua should stay home and rest.

400
00:28:09,140 --> 00:28:10,359
She'd be in a much better mood

401
00:28:10,401 --> 00:28:11,681
if you weren't hovering over her.

402
00:28:12,090 --> 00:28:12,940
But look,

403
00:28:13,490 --> 00:28:14,700
you just had to bring her along,

404
00:28:15,250 --> 00:28:16,900
without a thought for us women.

405
00:28:17,730 --> 00:28:18,700
I'm fine, Your Highness.

406
00:28:21,140 --> 00:28:22,250
Here, have some.

407
00:28:23,010 --> 00:28:23,530
Give me that.

408
00:28:35,250 --> 00:28:36,290
This tastes better.

409
00:29:40,700 --> 00:29:41,810
(Why is he here?)

410
00:29:50,050 --> 00:29:51,330
(Why is he dressed as a eunuch?)

411
00:29:55,290 --> 00:29:55,730
Chunhua?

412
00:29:57,460 --> 00:29:57,940
Chunhua?

413
00:30:00,940 --> 00:30:01,900
Why aren't you eating?

414
00:30:02,730 --> 00:30:03,420
Let me feed you.

415
00:30:10,290 --> 00:30:11,050
I beg to be excused

416
00:30:11,620 --> 00:30:12,330
for a moment.

417
00:30:13,980 --> 00:30:14,250
Chunhua...

418
00:30:18,250 --> 00:30:19,290
Still eating?

419
00:30:20,010 --> 00:30:21,330
Go check on her.

420
00:30:30,050 --> 00:30:31,140
You little brat!

421
00:30:31,900 --> 00:30:33,290
Did you do it?

422
00:30:33,490 --> 00:30:33,900
I didn't do it!

423
00:30:34,330 --> 00:30:35,330
It wasn't me...

424
00:30:35,730 --> 00:30:36,119
I'm innocent...

425
00:30:36,161 --> 00:30:37,351
Tell me. Was it you?

426
00:30:37,900 --> 00:30:38,879
I swear it wasn't me!

427
00:30:38,921 --> 00:30:39,351
You still...

428
00:30:41,050 --> 00:30:41,490
Admit it!

429
00:30:42,180 --> 00:30:43,570
It wasn't me!

430
00:30:43,900 --> 00:30:44,700
Liu Wenji.

431
00:30:45,980 --> 00:30:48,180
A glass goblet just went missing.

432
00:30:48,700 --> 00:30:49,530
Did you take it?

433
00:30:50,700 --> 00:30:51,420
What goblet?

434
00:30:51,860 --> 00:30:53,229
When you came in,

435
00:30:53,271 --> 00:30:55,201
you were holding one.

436
00:30:56,570 --> 00:30:58,180
So it was you, Liu Wenji!

437
00:30:58,730 --> 00:30:59,730
The banquet's about to begin.

438
00:30:59,860 --> 00:31:02,180
Hurry! Hand over the goblet!

439
00:31:02,860 --> 00:31:03,490
I remember

440
00:31:04,050 --> 00:31:05,330
I left it right there.

441
00:31:06,220 --> 00:31:08,090
I didn't take it when I went out.

442
00:31:08,730 --> 00:31:09,770
Didn't you hear?

443
00:31:10,900 --> 00:31:13,359
Mr. Wang saw you with it.

444
00:31:13,401 --> 00:31:15,031
Still denying it?

445
00:31:17,050 --> 00:31:17,810
I really didn't take it.

446
00:31:19,980 --> 00:31:21,050
Now I see.

447
00:31:21,900 --> 00:31:23,509
Liu Wenji was acting strange

448
00:31:23,551 --> 00:31:25,351
all morning,

449
00:31:25,770 --> 00:31:26,860
hovering around the table.

450
00:31:27,140 --> 00:31:30,460
He must've waited
till everyone was busy,

451
00:31:30,570 --> 00:31:33,570
snatched a goblet,

452
00:31:33,700 --> 00:31:35,530
slipped it up his sleeve,

453
00:31:36,010 --> 00:31:37,490
and thought no one would notice.

454
00:31:37,770 --> 00:31:38,290
Am I right?

455
00:31:45,380 --> 00:31:46,090
Search me if you like.

456
00:31:48,290 --> 00:31:49,380
Who'd be stupid enough

457
00:31:49,980 --> 00:31:51,220
to carry stolen goods on them?

458
00:31:51,810 --> 00:31:52,940
You stepped out just now

459
00:31:53,250 --> 00:31:55,620
and have hidden it somewhere.

460
00:32:00,250 --> 00:32:01,010
I swear I didn't take it.

461
00:32:01,860 --> 00:32:02,660
Please investigate

462
00:32:03,090 --> 00:32:03,900
and clear my name.

463
00:32:05,090 --> 00:32:07,010
Still being stubborn?

464
00:32:07,530 --> 00:32:08,620
You won't confess?

465
00:32:09,250 --> 00:32:09,810
Guards!

466
00:32:12,380 --> 00:32:12,770
Seize him!

467
00:32:13,180 --> 00:32:13,620
Hold him down!

468
00:32:16,980 --> 00:32:17,860
Your word isn't proof.

469
00:32:18,090 --> 00:32:19,460
What makes you think I took it?

470
00:32:19,620 --> 00:32:19,980
What?

471
00:32:20,460 --> 00:32:21,620
You want proof?

472
00:32:21,980 --> 00:32:22,530
Fine.

473
00:32:22,810 --> 00:32:24,860
Then I'll prove it right now!

474
00:32:25,220 --> 00:32:25,860
What's all the shouting?

475
00:32:27,420 --> 00:32:28,570
Making such a scene.

476
00:32:28,770 --> 00:32:29,420
I'm warning you,

477
00:32:29,490 --> 00:32:31,269
if you disturb the noble guests,

478
00:32:31,311 --> 00:32:32,369
your punishment will be even worse!

479
00:32:32,411 --> 00:32:33,561
I said I didn't do it!

480
00:32:33,660 --> 00:32:34,119
Let me go!

481
00:32:34,161 --> 00:32:35,071
Shut up!

482
00:32:35,180 --> 00:32:36,810
- Let go...
- Stop making a scene!

483
00:32:36,940 --> 00:32:37,530
Mr. Han.

484
00:32:39,140 --> 00:32:41,359
How does palace law deal with

485
00:32:41,401 --> 00:32:43,351
a thief like this?

486
00:32:44,050 --> 00:32:44,660
Rest assured.

487
00:32:44,730 --> 00:32:45,730
I know the rules.

488
00:32:46,090 --> 00:32:47,229
First, break his legs,

489
00:32:47,271 --> 00:32:48,961
then throw him out of the palace.

490
00:32:50,860 --> 00:32:51,420
Let me go!

491
00:32:52,220 --> 00:32:52,770
What right do you have?

492
00:32:53,090 --> 00:32:54,481
- Why are you framing me?
- Look at me!

493
00:32:54,530 --> 00:32:55,309
- Why frame me?
- Look at me!

494
00:32:55,351 --> 00:32:55,989
- Look at me!
- Why...

495
00:32:56,031 --> 00:32:57,241
I said look at me!

496
00:32:58,290 --> 00:33:00,530
I knew you were an ungrateful snake.

497
00:33:00,730 --> 00:33:01,359
I didn't expect you

498
00:33:01,401 --> 00:33:02,969
to show your true colors so soon!

499
00:33:03,011 --> 00:33:04,041
I said I didn't do it!

500
00:33:04,140 --> 00:33:04,770
Let me go!

501
00:33:05,010 --> 00:33:05,749
Listen here.

502
00:33:05,791 --> 00:33:07,161
I've hated the sight of you for ages!

503
00:33:07,220 --> 00:33:08,989
I'll teach you a lesson today!

504
00:33:09,031 --> 00:33:09,799
I told you I didn't take it.

505
00:33:09,841 --> 00:33:10,321
Let him go!

506
00:33:23,620 --> 00:33:25,380
Who... who are you?

507
00:33:26,980 --> 00:33:27,530
Chunhua.

508
00:33:27,860 --> 00:33:28,730
Hurry!

509
00:33:31,140 --> 00:33:31,940
Greetings, Your Highness.

510
00:33:32,860 --> 00:33:33,860
What are you doing here?

511
00:33:35,050 --> 00:33:36,250
It's filthy here.

512
00:33:36,420 --> 00:33:37,490
Why'd you come here?

513
00:33:47,250 --> 00:33:47,730
Your Highness,

514
00:33:51,220 --> 00:33:52,180
I've caused trouble.

515
00:33:53,220 --> 00:33:54,420
Please forgive me.

516
00:33:56,010 --> 00:33:57,010
Wh-What happened?

517
00:33:58,900 --> 00:33:59,490
Just now,

518
00:34:00,380 --> 00:34:03,010
I saw how pretty
that eunuch's glass goblet was,

519
00:34:03,490 --> 00:34:04,490
so I took it.

520
00:34:05,290 --> 00:34:06,530
Then I accidentally

521
00:34:06,810 --> 00:34:08,210
dropped it into the pond.

522
00:34:09,980 --> 00:34:11,050
Well, accidents happen.

523
00:34:11,780 --> 00:34:12,650
If you like it,

524
00:34:13,490 --> 00:34:15,090
I'll send you a bunch.

525
00:34:15,460 --> 00:34:16,010
But

526
00:34:17,340 --> 00:34:18,300
these eunuchs

527
00:34:18,820 --> 00:34:20,340
are making such a fuss over it.

528
00:34:24,490 --> 00:34:25,420
It's just a cup.

529
00:34:26,380 --> 00:34:28,010
Let's say I dropped it by accident.

530
00:34:29,610 --> 00:34:30,740
No big deal.

531
00:34:32,650 --> 00:34:33,340
Back to your places.

532
00:34:33,820 --> 00:34:34,300
Understood.

533
00:34:35,740 --> 00:34:36,460
Move along.

534
00:34:36,820 --> 00:34:37,420
Easy now.

535
00:34:37,980 --> 00:34:38,420
Easy.

536
00:34:39,090 --> 00:34:39,860
Careful!

537
00:34:43,130 --> 00:34:43,690
Easy.

538
00:34:44,210 --> 00:34:44,820
Easy.

539
00:35:13,820 --> 00:35:15,090
Greetings, Your Highness.

540
00:35:16,860 --> 00:35:17,420
Watch your step.

541
00:35:21,010 --> 00:35:21,650
Chunhua, look.

542
00:35:23,050 --> 00:35:23,570
A toad.

543
00:35:26,940 --> 00:35:27,530
Oh, it's dead.

544
00:35:37,460 --> 00:35:37,690
You...

545
00:35:38,210 --> 00:35:39,380
Why are you being shy?

546
00:35:43,980 --> 00:35:44,780
You're a prince

547
00:35:45,170 --> 00:35:46,010
of noble status.

548
00:35:46,570 --> 00:35:47,610
Hurry back to your seat.

549
00:35:48,740 --> 00:35:49,900
I just threw up.

550
00:35:50,300 --> 00:35:51,460
I need some fresh air.

551
00:35:55,650 --> 00:35:57,260
Then... come find me soon.

552
00:35:58,260 --> 00:35:58,940
Hurry.

553
00:36:22,320 --> 00:36:25,280
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

554
00:36:26,130 --> 00:36:27,090
So it really was you.

555
00:36:27,090 --> 00:36:30,080
♪And break a heart that bears no blame?♪

556
00:36:30,550 --> 00:36:34,480
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

557
00:36:34,530 --> 00:36:37,750
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

558
00:36:38,850 --> 00:36:41,400
♪I've tasted the ache
of wanting in vain♪

559
00:36:42,520 --> 00:36:46,230
♪Time lies sealed
beneath clouds heavy with rain♪

560
00:36:47,360 --> 00:36:49,010
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

561
00:36:49,010 --> 00:36:49,340
Wait.

562
00:36:51,140 --> 00:36:54,060
♪What can I do,
with no one to light the way?♪

563
00:36:59,340 --> 00:37:00,340
We're already on different paths.

564
00:37:01,530 --> 00:37:03,770
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

565
00:37:03,820 --> 00:37:04,820
Why did you help me?

566
00:37:05,900 --> 00:37:07,130
No matter what you become,

567
00:37:07,172 --> 00:37:09,672
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

568
00:37:09,900 --> 00:37:10,690
I won't change.

569
00:37:11,860 --> 00:37:12,980
I never did,

570
00:37:15,490 --> 00:37:16,530
and I never will.

571
00:37:18,130 --> 00:37:20,580
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

572
00:37:22,210 --> 00:37:23,460
You know, even if you help me,

573
00:37:23,740 --> 00:37:26,070
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

574
00:37:26,900 --> 00:37:27,860
I won't thank you.

575
00:37:33,780 --> 00:37:34,420
I'm helping you

576
00:37:35,900 --> 00:37:37,980
because losing a cup
won't cost me anything.

577
00:37:39,490 --> 00:37:41,170
But if you're framed,
you'll lose your life.

578
00:37:42,300 --> 00:37:43,300
I don't need your gratitude.

579
00:37:45,490 --> 00:37:46,570
I just want you to live well.

580
00:37:48,610 --> 00:37:50,430
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

581
00:37:50,580 --> 00:37:52,850
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

582
00:37:53,340 --> 00:37:55,910
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

583
00:37:57,030 --> 00:38:00,700
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

584
00:38:01,510 --> 00:38:03,880
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

585
00:38:05,110 --> 00:38:07,080
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

586
00:38:07,130 --> 00:38:08,740
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

587
00:38:09,760 --> 00:38:11,990
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

588
00:38:16,690 --> 00:38:17,090
(Chunhua...)

589
00:38:19,530 --> 00:38:20,300
(If one day)

590
00:38:22,490 --> 00:38:24,090
(I rise above them all,)

591
00:38:25,980 --> 00:38:28,218
♪Could we meet anew in another life?♪

592
00:38:28,260 --> 00:38:28,879
(would we)

593
00:38:28,921 --> 00:38:30,441
(no longer have to live this way?)

594
00:38:32,550 --> 00:38:37,560
♪How sweet the spring,
how hard to leave♪

595
00:38:39,460 --> 00:38:40,239
Indeed.

596
00:38:40,281 --> 00:38:41,801
What a feast today.

597
00:38:44,690 --> 00:38:46,530
Your Royal Highness.

598
00:38:48,740 --> 00:38:50,210
Your Highness.

599
00:39:10,050 --> 00:39:12,610
His Majesty has arrived!

600
00:39:26,340 --> 00:39:28,460
Greetings, Your Majesty!

601
00:39:30,740 --> 00:39:31,380
Please, be seated.

602
00:39:32,170 --> 00:39:33,940
Thank you, Your Majesty!

603
00:40:32,170 --> 00:40:38,610
Greetings, Lord Yu!

604
00:40:45,060 --> 00:40:48,100
(Zhao Zongze, General of the Left
Imperial Guard, Zhao Lingfei's Father)

605
00:41:03,940 --> 00:41:04,530
Come on.

606
00:41:05,170 --> 00:41:05,780
Hurry.

607
00:41:35,090 --> 00:41:35,490
Your Majesty.

608
00:41:36,090 --> 00:41:37,490
Forgive me for keeping you waiting.

609
00:41:38,690 --> 00:41:39,130
No matter.

610
00:41:52,260 --> 00:41:53,690
Long live

611
00:41:56,010 --> 00:41:56,740
Your Majesty!

612
00:41:57,460 --> 00:41:59,420
Long live Your Majesty!

613
00:41:59,650 --> 00:42:02,490
Long live Your Majesty!

614
00:42:02,900 --> 00:42:05,090
The Chief of the Court
of State Ceremonial presents

615
00:42:05,490 --> 00:42:08,050
a collection of birthday greetings
from various nations

616
00:42:08,300 --> 00:42:10,460
in a gilded box!

617
00:42:11,340 --> 00:42:13,300
The Court of Imperial Sacrifices
presents

618
00:42:13,740 --> 00:42:17,570
three volumes of the newly composed
"Longevity Movement."

619
00:42:24,980 --> 00:42:25,780
Princess Danyang.

620
00:42:26,380 --> 00:42:27,940
Your birthday gifts each year

621
00:42:28,780 --> 00:42:29,900
are always so original.

622
00:42:30,340 --> 00:42:32,380
What have you prepared this year?

623
00:42:44,300 --> 00:42:45,210
What's this?

624
00:42:47,610 --> 00:42:48,210
Father,

625
00:42:48,740 --> 00:42:51,050
this precious stone comes
from Mount Lufu,

626
00:42:51,610 --> 00:42:53,340
where I prayed for Mother.

627
00:42:53,900 --> 00:42:55,690
After bringing it back,
I found skilled craftsmen

628
00:42:56,010 --> 00:42:57,210
to carve it into this inkstone.

629
00:42:57,740 --> 00:42:59,490
The carving took some time,

630
00:42:59,860 --> 00:43:01,460
but thankfully, it's ready for today.

631
00:43:01,860 --> 00:43:03,610
Wanyao, how thoughtful of you.

632
00:43:07,940 --> 00:43:08,740
What a coincidence.

633
00:43:09,460 --> 00:43:11,460
It seems I'm destined
to cross paths with Princess Danyang.

634
00:43:12,170 --> 00:43:12,570
Your Majesty,

635
00:43:14,300 --> 00:43:15,900
my gift is also made of stone.

636
00:43:17,980 --> 00:43:18,740
However,

637
00:43:20,050 --> 00:43:22,010
it surely pales in comparison
to Princess Danyang's fine gift.

638
00:43:22,740 --> 00:43:23,460
I hope Your Majesty

639
00:43:24,050 --> 00:43:25,010
will forgive its roughness.

640
00:43:26,420 --> 00:43:26,860
Bring it in!

641
00:43:34,980 --> 00:43:35,980
What's that enormous thing?

642
00:43:52,820 --> 00:43:53,650
What is it?

643
00:43:55,420 --> 00:43:57,130
It's a stone stele

644
00:43:57,740 --> 00:43:58,780
from the Central Circuit.

645
00:44:00,420 --> 00:44:02,690
After a century of wind and rain,
it still stands firm.

646
00:44:04,050 --> 00:44:05,210
A fitting gift to wish Your Majesty

647
00:44:05,820 --> 00:44:06,780
many more years of life.

648
00:44:08,260 --> 00:44:09,460
How thoughtful, General.

649
00:44:16,090 --> 00:44:17,260
Your Majesty, why not ask

650
00:44:19,010 --> 00:44:21,010
what's so special about this stele?

651
00:44:27,530 --> 00:44:28,669
It and the merit stele

652
00:44:28,711 --> 00:44:31,321
the court erected in North Jing
over a decade ago

653
00:44:33,090 --> 00:44:34,260
come from the same place.

654
00:44:35,900 --> 00:44:38,170
They're two halves of the same stone.

655
00:44:38,490 --> 00:44:39,740
It's... the merit stele!

656
00:44:39,980 --> 00:44:40,380
Oh...

657
00:44:41,530 --> 00:44:42,780
Mr. Yan.

658
00:44:43,820 --> 00:44:44,420
Could he mean

659
00:44:44,860 --> 00:44:46,460
the stele from the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors?

660
00:44:46,740 --> 00:44:48,210
The Shence Army marched
on North Jing back then

661
00:44:48,490 --> 00:44:50,130
and suffered heavy losses
before barely defeating the rebels.

662
00:44:50,690 --> 00:44:51,820
They carved a stele there
to commemorate their victory.

663
00:44:53,210 --> 00:44:54,210
So he's...

664
00:44:55,130 --> 00:44:56,090
challenging the court?

665
00:44:58,340 --> 00:44:58,860
Exactly.

666
00:44:59,460 --> 00:45:01,780
Meng Zaishi now commands
a hundred thousand troops.

667
00:45:02,170 --> 00:45:03,210
At his command,

668
00:45:03,530 --> 00:45:05,690
they could march straight on Sheng'an.

669
00:45:06,300 --> 00:45:07,130
If war breaks out again,

670
00:45:07,490 --> 00:45:08,650
victory is far from certain.

671
00:45:09,090 --> 00:45:10,170
So this stele

672
00:45:10,820 --> 00:45:11,780
isn't a birthday gift.

673
00:45:12,530 --> 00:45:13,570
It's an insult.

674
00:45:14,570 --> 00:45:16,050
As the saying goes,
one good turn deserves another.

675
00:45:16,460 --> 00:45:17,650
Since they share the same origin,

676
00:45:18,050 --> 00:45:19,130
how could I not return the favor?

677
00:45:19,610 --> 00:45:20,090
And besides,

678
00:45:21,130 --> 00:45:22,189
a little stone stele

679
00:45:22,231 --> 00:45:23,801
hardly conveys my sincerity.

680
00:45:24,570 --> 00:45:25,530
I've already ordered

681
00:45:25,900 --> 00:45:28,460
my Central Circuit troops at the border

682
00:45:30,900 --> 00:45:32,010
to join me in wishing Your Majesty

683
00:45:32,740 --> 00:45:34,010
a long and prosperous reign.

684
00:45:35,620 --> 00:45:40,259
(Next Episode Preview)

685
00:45:40,301 --> 00:45:41,171
I beg Your Majesty

686
00:45:41,460 --> 00:45:43,420
to grant me Princess Danyang's hand.

687
00:45:43,820 --> 00:45:44,860
Father, I have something to say.

688
00:45:45,050 --> 00:45:46,650
It's the perfect time for a hunt.

689
00:45:46,900 --> 00:45:48,090
Why not have him compete

690
00:45:48,300 --> 00:45:49,900
with the other suitors here?

691
00:45:49,980 --> 00:45:51,170
Whoever wins,

692
00:45:51,690 --> 00:45:53,820
I'll marry him.

693
00:45:57,640 --> 00:46:00,933
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

694
00:46:03,618 --> 00:46:08,534
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

695
00:46:10,728 --> 00:46:16,573
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

696
00:46:17,073 --> 00:46:22,299
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

697
00:46:25,068 --> 00:46:29,859
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

698
00:46:30,695 --> 00:46:36,774
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

699
00:46:38,575 --> 00:46:41,725
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

700
00:46:41,725 --> 00:46:43,373
♪Burning bright as a song♪

701
00:46:43,425 --> 00:46:47,149
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

702
00:46:47,527 --> 00:46:52,193
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

703
00:46:52,812 --> 00:46:56,853
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

704
00:46:57,344 --> 00:46:59,459
♪Not a single hour less♪

705
00:46:59,499 --> 00:47:06,445
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

706
00:47:07,208 --> 00:47:10,661
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

707
00:47:10,841 --> 00:47:13,986
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

708
00:47:14,425 --> 00:47:21,062
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

709
00:47:21,459 --> 00:47:23,497
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

710
00:47:23,497 --> 00:47:25,973
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

711
00:47:26,011 --> 00:47:28,480
♪You're the only one I need♪

712
00:47:28,684 --> 00:47:35,571
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

713
00:47:35,883 --> 00:47:39,154
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

714
00:47:39,459 --> 00:47:42,632
♪My last untouched innocence♪

715
00:47:42,956 --> 00:47:46,382
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

716
00:47:46,615 --> 00:47:49,840
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

717
00:47:50,171 --> 00:47:56,967
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

718
00:47:57,336 --> 00:47:59,398
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

719
00:47:59,399 --> 00:48:01,902
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

720
00:48:01,949 --> 00:48:04,287
♪You're the only one I need♪

721
00:48:04,518 --> 00:48:11,353
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

722
00:48:11,702 --> 00:48:13,320
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

723
00:48:13,450 --> 00:48:15,246
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

724
00:48:15,603 --> 00:48:18,620
♪You're the only one I need♪

725
00:48:18,660 --> 00:48:19,987
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

